# Scotty, Chief Engineer: "Tap an untapped artifact you control: Target creature can't be blocked this turn." Cast on turn 1
# off Island and three Moxen (the pool empties exactly), it taps a Mox for its own Memnite (CR 602.2a) on turn 3: the
# Memnite cannot be blocked (the refusal, CR 509.1b), so it connects alone and the Ornithopter survives to show the
# control: on turn 5 the effect has worn off (CR 611.2a) and the Ornithopter blocks the Memnite, so Bot2 stays at 19.

[Bot1 Deck]
Scotty, Chief Engineer
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Memnite
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

